        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: San Diego, Downtown San Diego, California, United States, Las Vegas Valley, Nevada\n- Products: San Diego International Airport, McCarran International Airport\n- Concepts: IATA codes, ICAO codes, FAA LID codes\n\nFacts:\n- San Diego International Airport, formerly known as Lindbergh Field, is an international airport located 3 miles northwest of Downtown San Diego, California, United States.\n- San Diego International Airport has the codes IATA SAN, ICAO KSAN, and FAA LID SAN.\n- McCarran International Airport is the primary commercial airport serving the Las Vegas Valley in Nevada.\n- McCarran International Airport has the codes IATA LAS, ICAO KLAS, and FAA LID LAS.",
